          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- `∫₀^∞ η₊² log(xt) dt = ∫ (g + D)² E (log x + u) du`. -/\ntheorem integral_etaPlus_sq_log_eq {x : ℝ} (hx : 0 < x) :\n    ∫ t in Ioi 0, etaPlus t ^ 2 * Real.log (x * t) =\n      ∫ u, (gL u + Dg u) ^ 2 * Ew u * (Real.log x + u) := by\n  rw [← integral_comp_exp]\n  congr 1; ext u\n  rw [smul_eq_mul, Real.log_mul hx.ne' (Real.exp_pos u).ne', Real.log_exp]\n  have hD : gL u + Dg u = hH 200 (Real.exp u) := by unfold Dg; ring\n  rw [hD, etaPlus, Ew, exp_sq_eq]; ring",
            "line": 876,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.MajorArcs.integral_etaPlus_sq_log_eq",
            "lines": [
              876,
